<title>UKRAINE: Hryvnia edged down to 1.834 from 1.824 per dlr in.</title>
<headline>Hryvnia edged down to 1.834 from 1.824 per dlr in.</headline>
<dateline>KIEV 1996-11-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>The hryvnia edged down to 1.834 per dollar on the Ukrainian Interbank Currency Exchange from 1.824 at the previous session.</p>
<p>				    November 4	   November 1</p>
<p> Hryvnia rate to dollar	  1.834		  1.824</p>
<p> Volume traded		  $10.030 million	  $11.050 million</p>
<p>--Kiev newsroom, +380 44 229 2264</p>
</text>
